guideSupplements["downloads"].push({id:"browser-converter",title:L("The upstream browser converter","上游浏览器转换器","محول المتصفح الرسمي للمشروع","Conversor do projeto no navegador","Upstream-Konverter im Browser","Convertisseur upstream dans le navigateur","Conversor upstream en el navegador"),body:[L("Upstream now links a browser converter and describes conversion as staying on your device; the page still downloads its tool and runtime libraries. On this review it pins v0.1.1 libraries. Linux reports #5381 describe newer converted imports those libraries lack; proposed #5409 was closed without merging. Do not treat the browser tool as a verified one-click game launch. Prefer a converter and libraries built from one source commit when diagnosing this mismatch.","上游现已提供浏览器转换器，并说明转换留在本机；网页仍需下载工具和运行库。本轮其运行库清单固定为 v0.1.1。Linux #5381 报告新转换导入不在旧库中，提议修复 #5409 已关闭但未合并。不能把网页工具当作已验证的一键启动；排查配对问题时优先使用同一源码提交的转换器与运行库。","يربط المشروع محولاً في المتصفح ويصف التحويل بأنه محلي؛ الصفحة تحمل الأداة والمكتبات عبر الشبكة. المكتبات مثبتة على v0.1.1. يذكر #5381 واردات Linux أحدث مفقودة؛ #5409 أغلق دون دمج. ليس تشغيل لعبة مؤكداً بنقرة. للتشخيص استعمل المحول والمكتبات من التزام واحد.","O projeto liga um conversor no navegador com conversão local; a página descarrega ferramenta e bibliotecas. Estas continuam v0.1.1. #5381 relata imports Linux mais novos ausentes; #5409 fechado sem merge. Não é arranque de jogos verificado num clique. Para diagnosticar, compile conversor/bibliotecas do mesmo commit.","Upstream verlinkt einen Browser-Konverter mit lokaler Umwandlung; Tool und Bibliotheken werden heruntergeladen. Bibliotheken weiterhin v0.1.1. #5381 meldet neuere fehlende Linux-Imports; #5409 ohne Merge geschlossen. Kein verifizierter Spielstart per Klick. Zur Diagnose Konverter/Bibliotheken vom selben Commit bauen.","Upstream propose un convertisseur navigateur décrit comme local ; outil et bibliothèques sont téléchargés. Bibliothèques encore v0.1.1. #5381 signale des imports Linux récents absents ; #5409 fermé sans intégration. Pas de lancement de jeu vérifié en un clic. Diagnostiquez avec outil/bibliothèques du même commit.","Upstream ofrece conversor de navegador con conversión local; descarga herramienta y bibliotecas. Estas siguen v0.1.1. #5381 indica imports Linux nuevos ausentes; #5409 cerrado sin merge. No es inicio de juegos verificado en un clic. Diagnostica usando conversor/bibliotecas del mismo commit.")],links:[{"label": {"en": "Upstream browser converter", "zh": "上游浏览器转换器", "ar": "محول المتصفح للمشروع", "pt": "Conversor do projeto", "de": "Upstream-Browserkonverter", "fr": "Convertisseur upstream", "es": "Conversor upstream"}, "url": "https://boykopovar.github.io/AnyPS5/"}, {"label": "Issue #5381", "url": "https://github.com/boykopovar/AnyPS5/issues/5381"}, {"label": "PR #5409", "url": "https://github.com/boykopovar/AnyPS5/pull/5409"}]});

