guideSupplements["start"].push({id:"browser-converter",title:L("The upstream browser converter","上游浏览器转换器","محول المتصفح الرسمي للمشروع","Conversor do projeto no navegador","Upstream-Konverter im Browser","Convertisseur upstream dans le navigateur","Conversor upstream en el navegador"),body:[L("Upstream now links a browser converter and describes conversion as staying on your device; the page still downloads its tool and runtime libraries. On this review it pins v0.1.1 libraries. Linux reports #5381 describe newer converted imports those libraries lack; proposed #5409 was closed without merging. Do not treat the browser tool as a verified one-click game launch. Prefer a converter and libraries built from one source commit when diagnosing this mismatch.","上游现已提供浏览器转换器，并说明转换留在本机；网页仍需下载工具和运行库。本轮其运行库清单固定为 v0.1.1。Linux #5381 报告新转换导入不在旧库中，提议修复 #5409 已关闭但未合并。不能把网页工具当作已验证的一键启动；排查配对问题时优先使用同一源码提交的转换器与运行库。","يربط المشروع محولاً في المتصفح ويصف التحويل بأنه محلي؛ الصفحة تحمل الأداة والمكتبات عبر الشبكة. المكتبات مثبتة على v0.1.1. يذكر #5381 واردات Linux أحدث مفقودة؛ #5409 أغلق دون دمج. ليس تشغيل لعبة مؤكداً بنقرة. للتشخيص استعمل المحول والمكتبات من التزام واحد.","O projeto liga um conversor no navegador com conversão local; a página descarrega ferramenta e bibliotecas. Estas continuam v0.1.1. #5381 relata imports Linux mais novos ausentes; #5409 fechado sem merge. Não é arranque de jogos verificado num clique. Para diagnosticar, compile conversor/bibliotecas do mesmo commit.","Upstream verlinkt einen Browser-Konverter mit lokaler Umwandlung; Tool und Bibliotheken werden heruntergeladen. Bibliotheken weiterhin v0.1.1. #5381 meldet neuere fehlende Linux-Imports; #5409 ohne Merge geschlossen. Kein verifizierter Spielstart per Klick. Zur Diagnose Konverter/Bibliotheken vom selben Commit bauen.","Upstream propose un convertisseur navigateur décrit comme local ; outil et bibliothèques sont téléchargés. Bibliothèques encore v0.1.1. #5381 signale des imports Linux récents absents ; #5409 fermé sans intégration. Pas de lancement de jeu vérifié en un clic. Diagnostiquez avec outil/bibliothèques du même commit.","Upstream ofrece conversor de navegador con conversión local; descarga herramienta y bibliotecas. Estas siguen v0.1.1. #5381 indica imports Linux nuevos ausentes; #5409 cerrado sin merge. No es inicio de juegos verificado en un clic. Diagnostica usando conversor/bibliotecas del mismo commit.")],links:[{"label": {"en": "Upstream browser converter", "zh": "上游浏览器转换器", "ar": "محول المتصفح للمشروع", "pt": "Conversor do projeto", "de": "Upstream-Browserkonverter", "fr": "Convertisseur upstream", "es": "Conversor upstream"}, "url": "https://boykopovar.github.io/AnyPS5/"}, {"label": "Issue #5381", "url": "https://github.com/boykopovar/AnyPS5/issues/5381"}, {"label": "PR #5409", "url": "https://github.com/boykopovar/AnyPS5/pull/5409"}]});

guideSupplements["guides/linux"]??=[];
guideSupplements["guides/linux"].push({id:"release-display",title:L("v0.1.1 X11 window failures","v0.1.1 的 X11 窗口失败","فشل نافذة X11 في v0.1.1","Falha de janela X11 em v0.1.1","X11-Fensterfehler in v0.1.1","Échec de fenêtre X11 dans v0.1.1","Fallo de ventana X11 en v0.1.1"),body:[L("Issue #5383 reports offscreen-only SDL in the v0.1.1 Linux libraries: forcing x11 gives “x11 not available”, not a game-specific rendering result. Our digest-checked archive inspection finds OFFSCREEN_bootstrap but no X11_bootstrap/libX11.so strings; we did not run it. #5396 adds release-build X11/Xext headers but remains open and has no release-build verification. A local main build with the documented display/audio dependencies is the reported route; replacing variables alone cannot add a compiled-out backend.","#5383 报告 v0.1.1 Linux 库中的 SDL 仅有 offscreen，强制 x11 得到 x11 not available，不属于某款游戏渲染结果。本站校验附件摘要并静态检查，找到 OFFSCREEN_bootstrap 而无 X11_bootstrap／libX11.so 字符串，没有执行库。#5396 增加发行构建 X11／Xext 头文件，仍开放且未验证发行构建。来源使用具备文档依赖的本地 main 构建；单改变量不能补出未编译后端。","يذكر #5383 SDL offscreen فقط في مكتبات v0.1.1 ؛ x11 not available ليس نتيجة رسم لعبة. فحصنا الأرشيف المتحقق بالهاش: OFFSCREEN_bootstrap دون X11_bootstrap/libX11.so ، ولم نشغله. #5396 مفتوح بلا بناء إصدار مثبت. البناء المحلي بالاعتماديات هو المسار المبلغ عنه؛ متغير لا يضيف backend غير مبني.","#5383 relata SDL só offscreen nas bibliotecas v0.1.1; x11 not available não é resultado de jogo. Inspeção estática com hash confirmado: OFFSCREEN_bootstrap, sem X11_bootstrap/libX11.so; não executámos. #5396 aberto sem verificar release build. A via relatada é main local com dependências; variáveis não adicionam backend não compilado.","#5383 meldet SDL nur offscreen in v0.1.1; x11 not available ist kein Spielrendering-Ergebnis. Statische Archivprüfung mit bestätigtem Hash: OFFSCREEN_bootstrap, kein X11_bootstrap/libX11.so; nicht ausgeführt. #5396 offen ohne Release-Build-Verifizierung. Berichtet wird lokales main mit Abhängigkeiten; Variablen bauen kein fehlendes Backend ein.","#5383 rapporte SDL seulement offscreen dans v0.1.1 ; x11 not available n’est pas un résultat de jeu. Inspection statique avec hash validé : OFFSCREEN_bootstrap sans X11_bootstrap/libX11.so ; aucune exécution. #5396 ouvert sans build release vérifié. La voie rapportée est main local avec dépendances ; une variable ne compile pas un backend.","#5383 indica SDL solo offscreen en v0.1.1; x11 not available no es resultado de juego. Inspección estática con hash verificado: OFFSCREEN_bootstrap sin X11_bootstrap/libX11.so; no ejecutamos. #5396 abierto sin release build validado. La vía indicada es main local con dependencias; variables no compilan un backend.")],links:[{"label": "Issue #5383", "url": "https://github.com/boykopovar/AnyPS5/issues/5383"}, {"label": "PR #5396", "url": "https://github.com/boykopovar/AnyPS5/pull/5396"}]});

guideSupplements["guides/linux"]??=[];
guideSupplements["guides/linux"].push({id:"udmabuf-size",title:L("dma-buf permissions and size are different limits","dma-buf 权限与尺寸是不同限制","حد الحجم مختلف عن صلاحيات dma-buf","Permissões e tamanho dma-buf são limites diferentes","dma-buf-Rechte und Größe sind verschiedene Limits","Droits et taille dma-buf sont deux limites","Permisos y tamaño dma-buf son límites distintos"),body:[L("Permission denied and an EINVAL UDMABUF_CREATE failure need different checks. In #5329 a single 147.6 MiB range exceeds that host’s 64 MiB size_limit_mb; a temporary 2048 MiB limit passes the import but does not solve the later Vulkan timeout. A run-list PR does not automatically cover an oversized single run. Inspect the host’s actual limit and failed range before changing it; the reported temporary setting resets on reboot.","Permission denied 与 EINVAL 的 UDMABUF_CREATE 失败需要不同检查。#5329 中单个 147.6 MiB 范围超过该主机 64 MiB 的 size_limit_mb，临时提高到 2048 MiB 后可导入，但没有解决后来 Vulkan 超时。run-list PR 不自动覆盖单个过大范围。先核对真实上限和失败范围；来源临时设置重启后恢复。","Permission denied و EINVAL في UDMABUF_CREATE مختلفان. في #5329 تجاوز نطاق 147.6 MiB حد 64 MiB ؛ رفع مؤقت إلى 2048 يمرر الاستيراد لا مهلة Vulkan التالية. PR run-list لا يغطي كل نطاق كبير. افحص الحد الفعلي قبل تغييره؛ المؤقت ينتهي عند إعادة التشغيل.","Permission denied e EINVAL UDMABUF_CREATE são diferentes. #5329:147,6 MiB excede64 MiB;2048 temporário passa importação, não timeout Vulkan posterior. PR run-list não cobre todo intervalo grande. Verifique limite real antes de alterar; ajuste temporário reinicia com o sistema.","Permission denied und EINVAL bei UDMABUF_CREATE unterscheiden sich. #5329:147,6 MiB über 64 MiB; temporär2048 ermöglicht Import, nicht späteren Vulkan-Timeout. Run-list-PR deckt nicht jeden großen Bereich ab. Tatsächliches Limit prüfen; temporärer Wert endet beim Neustart.","Permission denied et EINVAL UDMABUF_CREATE diffèrent. #5329 :147,6 MiB dépasse64 MiB ;2048 temporaire permet import, pas correction du timeout suivant. PR run-list ne couvre pas chaque grande plage. Vérifiez limite réelle avant modification ; temporaire réinitialisé au redémarrage.","Permission denied y EINVAL UDMABUF_CREATE difieren. #5329:147,6 MiB supera64 MiB;2048 temporal permite import, no corrige timeout posterior. PR run-list no cubre todo rango grande. Comprueba límite real antes de cambiar; temporal se reinicia al arrancar.")],code:"cat /sys/module/udmabuf/parameters/size_limit_mb",links:[{"label": "Issue #5329", "url": "https://github.com/boykopovar/AnyPS5/issues/5329"}, {"label": "Issue #5332", "url": "https://github.com/boykopovar/AnyPS5/issues/5332"}]});

guideSupplements["guides/windows"]??=[];
guideSupplements["guides/windows"].push({id:"trace-imports",title:L("Trace imports with a matching main build","用配套 main 构建追踪导入","تتبع الاستيراد ببناء main مطابق","Rastrear imports com um build main correspondente","Imports mit passendem main-Build verfolgen","Tracer les imports avec un build main cohérent","Trazar imports con un build main correspondiente"),body:[L("Current source documents --trace-imports with --windows, conflicting with --lazy-binding. APS5_TRACE_CALLS=1 enables a 256-call ring and import call counts; without it the trampoline still has overhead. Use matching main libraries, not v0.1.1 assumptions. --windows-fixed-base is an advanced address-placement diagnostic: it disables main-image ASLR and fails if occupied, not a compatibility or FPS fix.","当前源码支持 --windows 下的 --trace-imports，与 --lazy-binding 冲突。APS5_TRACE_CALLS=1 启用 256 次调用环及导入次数统计；不启用时跳板仍有开销。使用配套 main 库，不能假定 v0.1.1 支持。--windows-fixed-base 是高级地址定位诊断，会关闭主映像 ASLR、地址占用时加载失败，不是兼容或 FPS 修复。","يوثق المصدر --trace-imports مع --windows ويتعارض مع --lazy-binding. APS5_TRACE_CALLS=1 يسجل 256 نداء وعدد الاستيرادات؛ حتى دون التسجيل للترامبولين كلفة. مكتبات main مطابقة، لا افتراض v0.1.1. --windows-fixed-base تشخيص متقدم بلا ASLR ، يفشل عند شغل العنوان وليس إصلاح أداء.","O source atual tem --trace-imports com --windows, incompatível com --lazy-binding. APS5_TRACE_CALLS=1 regista256 chamadas e contagens; trampoline tem custo mesmo desligado. Use libs main correspondentes, não pressuponha v0.1.1. --windows-fixed-base é diagnóstico sem ASLR, falha em endereço ocupado, não fix FPS.","Aktuelle Quellen haben --trace-imports mit --windows, inkompatibel zu --lazy-binding. APS5_TRACE_CALLS=1 zeichnet256 Aufrufe/Zähler auf; Trampoline kosten auch ohne Aufzeichnung. Passende main-Libs, keine v0.1.1-Annahme. --windows-fixed-base diagnostiziert Platzierung ohne ASLR; besetzte Adresse scheitert, kein FPS-Fix.","Source actuel : --trace-imports avec --windows, incompatible --lazy-binding. APS5_TRACE_CALLS=1 garde256 appels/compteurs ; trampoline coûte même désactivé. Bibliothèques main correspondantes, pas d’hypothèse v0.1.1. --windows-fixed-base diagnostique sans ASLR, échoue si adresse occupée, pas de fix FPS.","Source actual: --trace-imports con --windows, incompatible --lazy-binding. APS5_TRACE_CALLS=1 guarda256 llamadas/contadores; trampoline cuesta aun desactivado. Bibliotecas main correspondientes, no supongas v0.1.1. --windows-fixed-base diagnostica sin ASLR, falla si dirección ocupada, no arreglo FPS.")],code:"relinker --windows --trace-imports source/eboot.elf runtime/app.exe\ncd runtime\n$env: APS5_TRACE_CALLS = '1'\n.\\app.exe",links:[{"label": "USAGE · dacd78525e", "url": "https://github.com/boykopovar/AnyPS5/blob/dacd78525e537a779682032c0ace7f7af120af05/docs/user/USAGE.md"}]});

guideSupplements["guides/build"]??=[];
guideSupplements["guides/build"].push({id:"module-and-executable",title:L("Module warnings and additional executables","模块警告与额外可执行文件","تحذيرات الوحدات والملفات التنفيذية الإضافية","Avisos de módulos e executáveis adicionais","Modulwarnungen und weitere Programme","Avertissements modules et exécutables supplémentaires","Avisos de módulos y ejecutables adicionales"),body:[L("Current main warns and skips bundled SELF/fSELF containers; a successful conversion can therefore omit required modules. Unwrap the modules you need before relinking and inspect warnings. --executable converts another title executable for sceSystemServiceLoadExec, but errors if its modules convert differently from the launcher; it is not a universal hand-over workaround. These are current-source options, not new v0.1.1 assets.","当前 main 对随游戏 SELF／fSELF 容器发警告并跳过，因此转换成功仍可能缺少必需模块。先解包需要的模块并核对警告。--executable 为 sceSystemServiceLoadExec 转换另一程序，但其模块转换结果与启动器不同时会报错，不是通用交接绕行。以上是当前源码选项，非新的 v0.1.1 附件。","يحذر main ويتجاوز SELF/fSELF المرفقة؛ نجاح التحويل قد يفتقد وحدات لازمة. فك المطلوبة وافحص التحذيرات. --executable يحول برنامجاً آخر لـ LoadExec لكنه يفشل عند اختلاف الوحدات عن المشغل،ليس تجاوزاً عاماً. خيارات مصدر حالي لا ملفات v0.1.1 جديدة.","Main avisa e ignora SELF/fSELF incluídos; conversão bem sucedida pode omitir módulos. Desembrulhe os necessários e leia avisos. --executable converte outro programa LoadExec, mas falha se módulos diferirem do lançador, não workaround universal. Opções source, não novos assets v0.1.1.","Main warnt und überspringt enthaltene SELF/fSELF; erfolgreiche Konvertierung kann Module auslassen. Benötigte entpacken, Warnungen prüfen. --executable konvertiert weiteres LoadExec-Programm, scheitert bei anders konvertierten Modulen; keine universelle Übergabe. Quellenoptionen, keine neuen v0.1.1-Dateien.","Main avertit et ignore SELF/fSELF inclus ; conversion réussie peut omettre modules. Déballez ceux requis et lisez avertissements. --executable convertit un autre programme LoadExec, mais échoue si modules diffèrent du lanceur, pas de solution universelle. Options source, pas de nouveaux assets v0.1.1.","Main avisa y omite SELF/fSELF incluidos; conversión correcta puede omitir módulos. Desempaqueta necesarios y revisa avisos. --executable convierte otro programa LoadExec, pero falla si módulos difieren del lanzador, no solución universal. Opciones source, no nuevos assets v0.1.1.")],links:[{"label": "USAGE · dacd78525e", "url": "https://github.com/boykopovar/AnyPS5/blob/dacd78525e537a779682032c0ace7f7af120af05/docs/user/USAGE.md"}, {"label": "Peace Walker · #5268", "url": "https://github.com/boykopovar/AnyPS5/discussions/5268"}]});
